  "name": "Dread Presence",
  "type": "effect",
  "img": "icons/magic/control/fear-fright-monster-grin-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You are inside an enemy's <strong>Dread Presence</strong> and are <strong>Frightened</strong>.</p>\n<hr />\n<p>The aura sets Frightened 1. Roll your Will save against the aura's owner (the higher of their Class DC and Spell DC) when you first enter and raise the value to match: 1 on a critical success, 2 on a success, 3 on a failure, 4 on a critical failure (and you drop what you hold and cannot use reactions inside the aura). While inside, and for 1 round after leaving, you cannot reduce Frightened below that result; 1 minute after a critical failure. Leaving and re-entering rerolls, taking the worse result.</p>\n<p>From the owner's 7th level you cannot reduce Frightened below 2 inside the aura, and below 3 from their 13th. From their 15th your attacks against them take a penalty equal to your Frightened value in addition to the usual one. From their 20th you cannot willingly move closer to them while inside.</p>\n<p>This effect arrives and leaves with the aura. It does not need removing by hand.</p>",
      "gm": ""
    },
